      "writtenOn": "2026-04-01T13:49:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Via [this](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/webpagereplay/src/webpagereplay/transformers.go;l\u003d515;drc\u003d8fe3b630b4c80e9c299a3d81518509a9633e612e) you mean? That\u0027d be user error IMO. Can you just capitalize the header in the JSON file?\n\nIf this actually happens on the web, it\u0027s fine, but please state so",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "ecd0658cd348cc97e7ebfcc947ca6fe0ac26d429",
