      "message": "Here, if both Content-Security-Policy and content-security-policy are present, you only look at the first one. But in the next CL, you transform both of them. It looks like a bug",
      "revId": "ecd0658cd348cc97e7ebfcc947ca6fe0ac26d429",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
