        "id": 1246261
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-07T13:24:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think that\u0027s a bug; at least not in this code. The new code employs more defensive programming than previously, but stops short of unnecessarily expensive checks, such as iterating over the Header to guarantee that there is 0-1 values that match the query. That seems like the correct balance to me.",
      "parentUuid": "0678187d_8bc8ffa2",
      "revId": "ecd0658cd348cc97e7ebfcc947ca6fe0ac26d429",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
