      "writtenOn": "2026-04-08T08:45:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My concern was in the difference of treatment between this CL and the next one - as in, \"is there any harm in calling transformCSPHeader() for both Content-Security-Policy and content-security-policy\"? After reading the code and playing with the snippets above, I\u0027ve concluded this part is fine. Chrome applies the intersection of \"Content-Security-Policy\" and \"content-security-policy\" lines, so allowlisting the script in each of these lines is not a problem",
      "parentUuid": "1bf9957f_5711014b",
